Z||000000||Philphine||11-30-2001||05:34 AM||||<BR>we've had one of the qualifying rounds of the x-games here the last 3 years. they build a big temporary park for it. just heard on the news the city's going to build a permanent one by spring. that means by the time it's built i'll be 42, but i've got to try it when it gets built. it's what i did growing up and only stopped 'cause the park we had closed and i felt too old to be street skating then (so don't ask why i should be trying it now).<P>so one day when the kids are in school and the park is deserted more or less i'll be there. <P>just be prepared for the injury post.<P><P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
